      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal yaa warkayagii rumaystay? Oo yaa gacantii Rabbiga loo muujiyey? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, isagu hortiisuu ku koray sidii geed curdan ah, iyo sidii xidid dhul engegan ka soo baxay oo kale. Isagu suurad iyo qurux aynu ku fiirinno toona ma leh, oo qurux aynu ku jeclaanno laguma arko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaga waa la quudhsaday, waana la diiday, oo wuxuu ahaa nin murugeed, oo xanuun bartay, waana la quudhsaday sida mid dadku wejiga ka qarsado, mana aynaan xurmayn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sida runta ah wuxuu xambaartay xanuunyadeennii, wuxuuna qaatay murugadeennii, laakiinse waxaynu ku tirinnay mid belaayo ku dhacday, oo Ilaah dilay, oo dhibaataysan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse waxaa isaga loo dhaawacay xadgudubyadeenna, waxaana loo nabareeyey xumaatooyinkeenna, edbintii nabaadiinadeennana dushiisay ku dhacday, dildillaaciisiina waynu ku bogsannay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhammaanteen sidii ido baynu u hallownay, midkeen waluba jidkiisuu u leexday, oo Rabbigu wuxuu isaga dul saaray xumaanteenna oo dhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaga waa la dulmay, waana la dhibay, laakiinse innaba afkiisii ma uu kala qaadin. Isaga sidii wan la qalayo baa loo kexeeyey, oo sidii lax ku aamusan kuwa dhogorta ka xiira hortooda, isagu afkiisa ma uu furin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaga dulmi iyo xukun baa lagu sii qaaday. Haddaba bal yaa qarnigiisii ka mid ahaa oo u maleeyey in isaga laga gooyay dalkii kuwa nool? Xadgudubka dadkayga daraaddiis ayaa isaga loo garaacay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xabaashiisiina waxaa lagu daray kuwii sharka lahaa, dhimashadiisiina mid taajir ahaa, in kastoo uusan dulmi samayn, khiyaanona aanay afkiisa ku jirin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habase ahaatee waxaa Rabbigu raalli ka noqday inuu isaga nabareeyo. Wuxuu isaga ku riday xanuun. Markaad naftiisa qurbaan dembi ka dhigtid ayuu arki doonaa farcankiisii, cimrigiisuna waa dheeraan doonaa, oo Rabbiga doonistiisuna gacantiisay ku liibaani doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuxuu arki doonaa waxay naftiisu ku dhibtootay, wuuna u riyaaqi doonaa. Addoonkayga xaqa ahuna aqoontiisa ayuu kuwa badan xaq kaga dhigi doonaa, wuxuuna xambaari doonaa xumaatooyinkooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 53:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed waxaan isaga wax ula qaybin doonaa kuwa waaweyn, isna wuxuu boolida la qaybsan doonaa kuwa xoogga badan, maxaa yeelay, isagu naftiisuu geeri u huray, waxaana lagu tiriyey kuwa xadgudbay, weliba wuxuu xambaartay kuwa badan dembigood, wuuna u duceeyey kuwa xadgudbay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.53.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.53.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
